Z||000000||DisfourDan||05-28-2001||12:27 AM||||alright guys, here is a question.  Do i need to have insurance on my Fiero if I would not be driving it, and it would be in my backyard.  I really need to know this, because that is the only reason my dad will not let me buy it now.||||reg||1
Z||000001||DisfourDan||05-28-2001||12:42 AM||||bump, must stay on top||||reg||1
Z||000002||sjp777||05-28-2001||12:45 AM||||You don't need insurance for a car that's not on the road, but you probably need proof of insurance to get it registered and plates.<P>But who buys a Fiero not to drive it?<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_2.jpg">    <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Uaana||05-28-2001||12:50 AM||||Tell your dad to get Storage ins on it.<BR>It's like 5-10 a month for a car that isn't being driven. And it's full comp so if it gets swallowed in an earthquake or flood fire ect. Youre covered.<BR>So I take it you were able to talk mom into this?||||reg||1
Z||000004||DisfourDan||05-28-2001||12:53 AM||||she does not care anymore, now its more of an insurance thing.  I want to get the car now, and fix up the engine and all the other problems, this will take about a month or so, So that would mean i wont be driving it.  And since i wont be driving it, i would not need to have insurance on it.  But the thing is, like one of the guys already stated, I would need proof of insurance to regiter it.  What would i do?||||reg||1
Z||000005||sjp777||05-28-2001||01:03 AM||||Do the title transfer when you get it, but don't go for plates until it's ready to drive||||reg||1
Z||000006||DisfourDan||05-28-2001||01:06 AM||||Thanks guys, I am now able to buy my Fiero, <BR>Now its time to search for some good deals.  Thanks again.||||reg||1
Z||000007||tgowens||05-28-2001||01:25 AM||||you can title the car and get a non-op (non-operational vehicle) registration for $10..........then when you are ready to drive it you will need the insurance and smog certificate to register it.||||reg||1
